	"notice": "MK4 mini-key variant, distinct from Launchkey Mini MK3 and full-size Launchkey MK4. Use the musical MIDI endpoint for keys/custom modes; DAW endpoints need the corresponding host integration. Configure custom maps with Novation Components. Physical controls and keys remain unbound because presets, modes and octave settings determine messages. Diagrams are selected-control schematics, not dimensioned panel drawings. Port names are recorded only when documented; otherwise detection uses an unambiguous complete model name or manual selection.",
